('qcent-woods-resort-spa-rishikesh','Qcent Woods Resort & Spa','A riverside forest retreat in the lap of the Himalayas','Uttarakhand','Rishikesh','Neelkanth Road, Near Huel River, Rishikesh, Uttarakhand 249304',
 'https://qcenthotels.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/wood-resort1.png',
 '["https://qcenthotels.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/1-12.png","https://qcenthotels.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/4-13.png","https://qcenthotels.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/3-12.png","https://qcenthotels.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/5-11.png","https://qcenthotels.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/6-11.png","https://qcenthotels.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/1-13.png","https://qcenthotels.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/5-12.png","https://qcenthotels.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/6-12.png","https://qcenthotels.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/4-14.png","https://qcenthotels.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/3-13.png","https://qcenthotels.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/5-13.png","https://qcenthotels.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/6-13.png","https://qcenthotels.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/4-15.png","https://qcenthotels.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/1-14.png","https://qcenthotels.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/3-14.png","https://qcenthotels.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/2-13.png"]',
 'Welcome to Qcent Woods Resort & Spa, The Stay you are looking for.',
 'Qcent Woods Resort & Spa Rishikesh is one of the finest 4-star luxury riverside resorts in Rishikesh, offering premium accommodations perfectly blended with the breathtaking beauty of nature. Surrounded by the serene Himalayan landscape, the resort provides a soul-soothing view that makes it an ideal retreat in the sacred city of Rishikesh.

Just a short walk from the enchanting Huel River and the sacred Ganga, the tranquil atmosphere around Qcent Woods Resort & Spa is enhanced by the divine energy and peaceful sound of flowing waters. Focused on warm hospitality and exceptional service, the resort ensures a luxurious and comfortable experience for every guest, delivering best-in-class accommodation in Rishikesh for both leisure and spiritual travellers.',
 '["20 keys wooden cottage resort","Riverside location near Huel River & Ganga","Spa, bonfire & star gazing","24-hour room service"]',
 '[{"name":"Room Service","icon":"concierge-bell","description":"24-hour in-room dining","category":"Services"},{"name":"Wifi & Internet","icon":"wifi","description":"Complimentary high-speed Wi-Fi","category":"Connectivity"},{"name":"Reception","icon":"bell-ring","description":"24x7 front desk & concierge","category":"Services"},{"name":"Breakfast","icon":"coffee","description":"Multi-cuisine breakfast spread","category":"Dining"},{"name":"Parking","icon":"car","description":"Free on-site parking","category":"Facilities"},{"name":"Pool","icon":"waves","description":"Open-air swimming pool","category":"Facilities"}]',
 '["Riverside bonfire & star gazing","Ganga aarti at Triveni Ghat","Guided forest walks","Ayurvedic spa therapies"]',
 '[{"name":"Neelkanth Mahadev Temple","distance":"18 km"},{"name":"Laxman Jhula","distance":"9 km"},{"name":"Triveni Ghat","distance":"12 km"},{"name":"Rishikesh Railway Station","distance":"14 km"},{"name":"Jolly Grant Airport","distance":"35 km"}]',
 '["Check-in 2:00 PM, Check-out 11:00 AM","Valid government photo ID required at check-in","Free cancellation up to 48 hours before arrival","Pets are not allowed"]',
 '{"phone":"+91 88006 99155","email":"info@qcenthotels.com","whatsapp":"918800699155"}',
 '{"lat":30.1087,"lng":78.2932}','Resort',4.7,4500,NULL,'published',true,1),

